WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.316
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:23.586 --> 00:24.921
We're taking down the Tokugawa.

3
00:35.098 --> 00:36.057
An angel…

4
00:39.102 --> 00:40.395
Am I dreaming?

5
00:41.646 --> 00:42.564
You're awake.

6
00:48.486 --> 00:51.489
That's right. I fell…

7
00:54.909 --> 00:55.952
Was it you who…

8
00:56.578 --> 00:58.121
Thank him.

9
00:58.204 --> 00:59.664
Your wounds were severe,

10
00:59.747 --> 01:03.126
so I stitched them up and applied mugwort salve.

11
01:04.377 --> 01:07.505
You need at least three days of rest.

12
01:09.591 --> 01:10.884
I'll leave you some food.

13
01:13.094 --> 01:15.638
How about I treat you to tea sometime to thank you?

14
01:17.140 --> 01:19.017
What happened to your face?

15
01:25.064 --> 01:28.026
If you don't want to die, never touch me again.

16
01:28.109 --> 01:29.319
I can't breathe…

17
01:31.279 --> 01:35.742
Is Lord Yukimura really serious about letting him join us?

18
01:36.242 --> 01:37.452
I'm against it too.

19
01:38.077 --> 01:39.829
He said loyalty can go to hell.

20
01:40.580 --> 01:42.999
He's more of a thief than a ninja.

21
01:45.501 --> 01:46.920
A high-stakes gamble.

22
01:47.003 --> 01:48.755
Fifty-fifty.

23
01:48.838 --> 01:51.049
Who are you calling a thief, huh?

24
01:51.132 --> 01:52.800
-You sure talk a lot of trash. -Hey!

25
01:52.884 --> 01:55.595
I already told you, I'm not joining you.

26
01:55.678 --> 01:56.971
You're up already?

27
01:57.055 --> 02:00.350
Man, I'm starving. Give me more.

28
02:00.433 --> 02:03.019
-Rice is precious. -You're not getting any rice!

29
02:03.102 --> 02:04.145
Cheap bastard!

30
02:07.732 --> 02:09.525
Thanks for the food, though.

31
02:09.609 --> 02:11.736
Isa made it. The one over there.

32
02:13.821 --> 02:15.073
It was you?

33
02:15.156 --> 02:16.199
Got a problem with that?

34
02:17.784 --> 02:20.870
Perfect seasoning, perfect rice.

35
02:21.621 --> 02:22.997
You're a genius!

36
02:23.790 --> 02:26.501
Oh, really? Then try this, too.

37
02:26.584 --> 02:29.837
It's rare for Brother to like someone.

38
02:29.921 --> 02:31.005
Damn, that's good!

39
02:31.089 --> 02:33.466
You could make a fortune opening a restaurant.

40
02:33.549 --> 02:34.801
-A restaurant? -Yeah.

41
02:36.052 --> 02:38.137
Isa's cooking is good, isn't it?

42
02:38.221 --> 02:39.514
It's great.

43
02:39.597 --> 02:44.560
So, Sasuke, how about lending us a hand for a while?

44
02:45.144 --> 02:48.606
We're going to escape this place and head to Osaka Castle.

45
02:49.440 --> 02:50.692
We need your help.

46
02:50.775 --> 02:52.026
Escape?

47
02:52.110 --> 02:56.364
The Tokugawa have our lord confined here.

48
02:56.447 --> 02:57.782
Why Osaka?

49
02:57.865 --> 03:01.869
To save Lord Hideyori and his mother, Lady Yodo,

50
03:01.953 --> 03:03.871
who are resisting Ieyasu.

51
03:03.955 --> 03:08.960
Once we're in Osaka Castle, we can help you avenge the old man.

52
03:10.586 --> 03:12.672
Of course, you'll be rewarded.

53
03:13.673 --> 03:15.425
How about two gold coins?

54
03:15.508 --> 03:17.135
Two gold coins?

55
03:17.218 --> 03:19.679
You don't look like you've got that kind of money.

56
03:21.347 --> 03:22.724
Don't worry.

57
03:22.807 --> 03:26.144
Once we're in Osaka Castle, we should get a hefty advance.

58
03:27.729 --> 03:29.063
You're not lying, are you?

59
03:29.147 --> 03:31.941
Our lord defeated the Tokugawa twice.

60
03:32.692 --> 03:34.485
They'll welcome him with open arms.

61
03:37.113 --> 03:38.656
Three gold coins.

62
03:38.740 --> 03:40.241
Don't get too greedy!

63
03:40.325 --> 03:42.076
Careful about what you say.

64
03:43.036 --> 03:44.871
You need me, don't you?

65
03:46.539 --> 03:47.540
All right, then.

66
03:49.375 --> 03:51.544
I have one more condition.

67
03:52.211 --> 03:53.129
Let's hear it.

68
03:57.383 --> 04:00.803
When we get to Osaka, how about we go eat konpeito together?

69
04:01.596 --> 04:03.473
Enough of your nonsense, you filthy monkey.

70
04:04.182 --> 04:05.725
What's got you so riled up?

71
04:09.312 --> 04:12.815
-Don't tell me you have feelings for her? -That's not it.

72
04:16.527 --> 04:18.738
So, what do you want me to do?

73
04:19.739 --> 04:22.658
-Kill the enemy soldiers? -You stupid monkey.

74
04:22.742 --> 04:25.578
If it were that simple, we'd have done it ourselves by now.

75
04:26.662 --> 04:29.791
First, let me explain Kudoyama Village.

76
04:31.751 --> 04:34.462
The village is surrounded by rivers and fences,

77
04:34.545 --> 04:37.256
so everyone must pass through this checkpoint to enter or leave.

78
04:37.340 --> 04:38.925
INNER GATE

79
04:39.008 --> 04:42.387
The checkpoint has an inner and an outer gate,

80
04:42.470 --> 04:45.890
both heavily guarded by Shuto, the village watchman,

81
04:45.973 --> 04:48.309
and his men.

82
04:48.393 --> 04:50.978
There are also watchtowers.

83
04:51.062 --> 04:56.234
Each tower has a scout ninja watching over the entire village.

84
04:57.193 --> 04:59.946
The checkpoint also has a ninja who listens for sounds.

85
05:00.029 --> 05:01.989
They're always listening for anything suspicious,

86
05:02.073 --> 05:05.243
so the slightest noise will bring the guards running.

87
05:06.327 --> 05:08.871
We could just jump the fence like I did.

88
05:09.705 --> 05:12.959
Only you and Saizo could pull that off.

89
05:14.043 --> 05:18.131
This entire village is a prison to keep me confined.

90
05:18.214 --> 05:21.509
Of course, we've tried to escape many times over the past 14 years,

91
05:21.592 --> 05:23.386
but never succeeded.

92
05:23.469 --> 05:26.514
No wonder, with a bunch of losers like these.

93
05:26.597 --> 05:27.974
What do you mean by that?

94
05:28.558 --> 05:32.437
An old geezer, a dice-rolling old man, a bespectacled weakling, and…

95
05:34.522 --> 05:35.523
Who are you?

96
05:36.315 --> 05:38.609
You all look hopeless.

97
05:40.778 --> 05:42.738
If enemies show up, I'll take them all out myself.

98
05:42.822 --> 05:44.949
If they were that easy, we'd have done it ourselves.

99
05:45.825 --> 05:47.910
We've endured this long because we couldn't.

100
05:47.994 --> 05:51.330
-Don't get cocky, weakling. -Weakling? What?

101
05:52.081 --> 05:53.583
Then I'll show you.

102
05:54.250 --> 05:55.585
Watch closely.

103
06:00.840 --> 06:01.883
Clone.

104
06:08.097 --> 06:09.015
Clone!

105
06:12.310 --> 06:15.563
Even Saizo can't use the advanced Clone technique.

106
06:15.646 --> 06:18.774
-No way you can pull that off. -I did, I swear!

107
06:18.858 --> 06:22.195
My lord, he'll only disrupt our unity.

108
06:23.070 --> 06:24.447
I won't work with a monkey.

109
06:24.530 --> 06:25.698
Now, now…

110
06:25.781 --> 06:28.201
He's a flying monkey, at least.

111
06:28.284 --> 06:30.077
Who are you calling a flying monkey?!

112
06:30.161 --> 06:32.955
Come on, it's good to have someone with some guts around.

113
06:33.039 --> 06:36.250
Besides, he's just like I was when I was young.

114
06:37.210 --> 06:38.336
Don't be ridiculous.

115
06:38.419 --> 06:40.504
There's no way I'll turn into an old geezer like you!

116
06:42.757 --> 06:43.925
So…

117
06:44.008 --> 06:46.052
How do you plan to get out of the village?

118
06:46.594 --> 06:47.595
I've got a plan.

119
06:48.346 --> 06:49.430
Will you help me?

120
06:56.354 --> 06:57.730
Fine. But you owe me konpeito.

121
06:57.813 --> 06:58.731
Yuri…

122
06:58.814 --> 07:00.942
Fine, I'll help you.

123
07:04.612 --> 07:07.615
Lord Yukimura's orders are absolute. Can you follow them?

124
07:08.699 --> 07:10.576
I don't like being told what to do.

125
07:11.244 --> 07:12.995
I'll decide for myself.

126
07:14.121 --> 07:15.164
Very well.

127
07:15.831 --> 07:16.874
Saizo.

128
07:17.667 --> 07:21.712
Head into town and get us the latest firearms.

129
07:21.796 --> 07:22.797
Yes, sir.

130
07:23.381 --> 07:25.341
Firearms? Why?

131
07:25.424 --> 07:28.135
Ieyasu has ninja with superhuman abilities,

132
07:28.219 --> 07:30.596
led by Hattori Hanzo.

133
07:31.389 --> 07:33.808
We can't beat them in a fair fight.

134
07:36.852 --> 07:38.771
Hattori Hanzo…

135
07:40.523 --> 07:42.608
I've seen one of them myself.

136
07:43.568 --> 07:44.569
A ninja named…

137
07:46.445 --> 07:49.031
Tsuge Kiyohiro.

138
07:51.158 --> 07:52.952
This was just after the Battle of Sekigahara,

139
07:53.369 --> 07:55.705
when we were hiding at a post station.

140
08:03.921 --> 08:07.091
He was incredibly fast, and his body was tough.

141
08:10.219 --> 08:11.304
In an instant,

142
08:11.387 --> 08:13.055
he slaughtered every man there.

143
08:13.139 --> 08:14.515
TSUGE KIYOHIRO

144
08:16.309 --> 08:17.852
When I think back to that day,

145
08:19.061 --> 08:19.895
even now…

146
08:22.523 --> 08:23.482
Lord Daisuke.

147
08:25.610 --> 08:27.820
The moment you falter, you've already lost.

148
08:27.903 --> 08:30.823
No matter who the enemy is, they'll always have a weakness.

149
08:30.906 --> 08:33.534
Cast aside your fear and watch them closely.

150
08:35.119 --> 08:39.915
Everyone here has had their lives ruined by the Tokugawa.

151
08:42.251 --> 08:43.836
His master was killed.

152
08:45.212 --> 08:46.130
Just like you.

153
08:51.093 --> 08:52.136
Someone's coming.

154
08:54.847 --> 08:56.015
Come.

155
09:05.941 --> 09:07.526
Taking a nap?

156
09:09.570 --> 09:11.906
Must be nice.

157
09:11.989 --> 09:13.574
Lord Shuto.

158
09:14.116 --> 09:16.952
Forgive me for being seen in such an undignified state.

159
09:17.036 --> 09:18.287
What's with that?

160
09:18.871 --> 09:19.955
Pathetic.

161
09:21.123 --> 09:23.250
So, what brings you here?

162
09:23.334 --> 09:24.460
Last night,

163
09:26.253 --> 09:29.423
one of the guards claims he saw a figure flying through the air.

164
09:30.716 --> 09:32.093
A flying figure?

165
09:32.176 --> 09:36.222
You haven't secretly taken in any ninja,

166
09:37.348 --> 09:38.265
have you?

167
09:39.517 --> 09:41.268
Me? Take in a ninja?

168
09:43.020 --> 09:43.979
Of course not.

169
09:45.064 --> 09:48.109
What would anyone gain by serving a man like me?

170
09:50.319 --> 09:52.947
The village is bustling with preparations for the festival.

171
09:53.698 --> 09:57.243
Must've been a startled monkey jumping around.

172
09:59.787 --> 10:01.622
If I see anything suspicious,

173
10:02.707 --> 10:04.750
I'll kill every villager here!

174
10:06.293 --> 10:07.586
All of you together.

175
10:09.338 --> 10:10.965
You won't be lonely.

176
10:12.466 --> 10:14.176
-Let's go! -Yes, sir!

177
10:17.763 --> 10:21.142
FIREARMS FOR SALE

178
10:22.643 --> 10:23.894
Are you the foreigners?

179
10:25.229 --> 10:29.150
The ones who've crossed the sea from foreign lands?

180
10:30.860 --> 10:32.528
There's no need to be so wary.

181
10:32.611 --> 10:34.071
You're welcome here.

182
10:36.657 --> 10:38.075
Is that a firearm?

183
10:43.289 --> 10:44.373
Do it.

184
10:59.054 --> 11:00.139
I have a report.

185
11:03.768 --> 11:04.769
SUNPU CASTLE

186
11:04.852 --> 11:06.937
Shall we relocate Hideyori,

187
11:07.646 --> 11:10.065
or demand Lady Yodo as a hostage?

188
11:11.150 --> 11:15.070
After this much humiliation, surely they'll choose war.

189
11:15.654 --> 11:18.032
If he attacks someone who hasn't resisted,

190
11:19.074 --> 11:21.911
it'll tarnish his reputation as ruler of the realm.

191
11:23.704 --> 11:28.167
And what of the crackdown on foreign merchants?

192
11:28.751 --> 11:32.463
We've secured all the firearms in Japan.

193
11:33.923 --> 11:35.090
However…

194
11:35.174 --> 11:36.175
What?

195
11:36.258 --> 11:37.843
-Hanzo. -Yes, sir.

196
11:38.677 --> 11:39.803
Tell His Lordship.

197
11:41.013 --> 11:44.225
We've received word that a ninja has entered Kudoyama.

198
11:44.767 --> 11:46.268
One of Sanada's men?

199
11:46.352 --> 11:47.686
We don't know yet.

200
11:47.770 --> 11:49.063
Our two defeats

201
11:49.855 --> 11:51.982
were both due to ninja.

202
11:53.609 --> 11:56.737
We must never let the Sanada join forces with them!

203
11:57.863 --> 11:59.114
Under no circumstances!

204
12:04.954 --> 12:05.913
I can't see…

205
12:11.835 --> 12:12.753
Give it to me.

206
12:13.879 --> 12:14.755
Yes, sir.

207
12:18.133 --> 12:19.260
ARCHERY MASTER UNNO ROKURO

208
12:23.013 --> 12:25.099
Curved Shot, Wild God.

209
12:29.353 --> 12:30.479
Amazing!

210
12:30.563 --> 12:31.814
The arrow curved.

211
12:31.897 --> 12:33.857
The ultimate technique is an arrow that returns.

212
12:35.484 --> 12:36.610
Let's train.

213
12:36.694 --> 12:37.695
Yes, sir!

214
13:00.384 --> 13:01.594
Brother.

215
13:02.344 --> 13:03.304
You awake?

216
13:06.849 --> 13:09.059
There's one right here.

217
13:10.477 --> 13:11.770
Isn't that cheating?

218
13:15.149 --> 13:17.109
Can I really count on these guys?

219
13:31.832 --> 13:33.500
Time to eat…

220
13:40.174 --> 13:41.925
Time to eat!

221
13:47.014 --> 13:49.808
Fine. Come here.

222
13:53.979 --> 13:54.855
Here.

223
13:58.275 --> 13:59.151
Here.

224
14:01.987 --> 14:03.447
Hey! No thanks or anything?

225
14:03.530 --> 14:04.615
Mom.

226
14:05.240 --> 14:06.283
I got a rice ball.

227
14:06.367 --> 14:07.368
What?

228
14:15.167 --> 14:17.044
Let's eat together, Mom.

229
14:17.127 --> 14:18.128
Let's eat.

230
14:18.212 --> 14:19.630
Don't move!

231
14:21.048 --> 14:22.299
What's that?

232
14:23.133 --> 14:25.052
Isn't that a ninja tool?

233
14:25.135 --> 14:27.012
No, it's just a farming tool.

234
14:27.096 --> 14:28.305
Liar!

235
14:29.139 --> 14:30.015
Hey.

236
14:31.100 --> 14:33.143
What the hell is this?

237
14:33.227 --> 14:34.603
It's obviously a hoe.

238
14:36.605 --> 14:40.025
No one must know you're here.

239
14:40.609 --> 14:43.529
And don't leave the house. Not even a step. Understand?

240
14:46.156 --> 14:48.450
-Don't mess with me! -This way.

241
14:48.534 --> 14:50.619
Take that, you ninja!

242
14:51.370 --> 14:54.248
You ninja!

243
14:54.331 --> 14:56.917
This way, this way!

244
14:59.128 --> 15:01.296
-See you! -Thanks.

245
15:06.343 --> 15:08.012
They saved my butt.

246
15:16.353 --> 15:18.147
-Oh my! -Sasuke.

247
15:19.481 --> 15:20.566
Okuni?

248
15:23.527 --> 15:24.528
What are you doing here?

249
15:24.611 --> 15:27.781
I'm working at the village headman's house.

250
15:27.865 --> 15:29.324
What about you, Sasuke?

251
15:29.408 --> 15:31.910
Well, let's just say things happened.

252
15:33.620 --> 15:35.831
Keep it a secret that I'm here, okay?

253
15:37.583 --> 15:40.294
By the way, Sasuke, so that's your type?

254
15:41.962 --> 15:43.589
I saw you go, "Oh my!"

255
15:45.549 --> 15:46.800
Actually…

256
15:48.719 --> 15:51.096
I'm going to eat konpeito with someone soon.

257
15:51.180 --> 15:52.723
Oh, really?

258
15:54.183 --> 15:56.769
What about your promise to eat dango with me at the teahouse?

259
15:59.938 --> 16:01.231
Forget it.

260
16:04.651 --> 16:05.652
Good grief.

261
16:08.489 --> 16:10.616
I'm quite the heartbreaker, huh?

262
16:12.910 --> 16:13.911
You sure are.

263
16:15.579 --> 16:18.415
The sin of breaking a vow is a grave one.

264
16:23.212 --> 16:24.254
Oh my…

265
16:38.393 --> 16:40.229
PORT TOWN OF SAKAI

266
16:40.312 --> 16:41.313
What?

267
16:41.396 --> 16:43.107
-You don't sell any? -No.

268
16:43.857 --> 16:46.819
Lord Tokugawa has bought up all the firearms.

269
16:46.902 --> 16:48.987
I doubt you'll find any anywhere.

270
16:52.741 --> 16:54.493
Why am I stuck coming along, too?

271
16:54.576 --> 16:58.413
Because you can't sit still. They told me to take you outside.

272
16:58.497 --> 17:01.667
-I was just out for a walk. -How many times do I have to tell you?

273
17:01.750 --> 17:04.002
-If Shuto catches us… -Yeah, yeah.

274
17:05.379 --> 17:06.964
By the way…

275
17:07.756 --> 17:09.842
You look more important than me, dressed like that.

276
17:09.925 --> 17:12.886
Who cares about that? We need those firearms.

277
17:13.762 --> 17:15.681
We've got to find a way to get them.

278
17:19.393 --> 17:20.561
The smell of gunpowder…

279
17:57.973 --> 17:59.141
Stop!

280
17:59.892 --> 18:01.101
You're pretty good.

281
18:01.185 --> 18:02.895
Drop your weapon, Sasuke.

282
18:08.442 --> 18:09.735
Forgive me.

283
18:09.818 --> 18:13.488
This monkey doesn't know how to behave.

284
18:17.910 --> 18:20.078
A Westerner!

285
18:20.162 --> 18:21.914
I've never seen one before.

286
18:24.625 --> 18:26.919
Would you be willing to sell this to us?

287
18:29.588 --> 18:30.839
Then help us out.

288
18:31.006 --> 18:32.799
Seems we need firearms to take down Tokugawa.

289
18:32.883 --> 18:34.509
Hey! What the hell are you saying?

290
18:34.593 --> 18:35.844
Who are you?

291
18:36.845 --> 18:39.431
A ninja from Kudoyama, beyond those mountains.

292
18:40.766 --> 18:41.767
A ninja?

293
18:41.850 --> 18:44.353
You stupid monkey. Why would you reveal your identity?

294
18:44.436 --> 18:46.605
Shut up. We have to tell him if we're asking for help.

295
18:47.689 --> 18:48.815
Shakespeare said,

296
18:49.691 --> 18:52.903
"Brevity is the soul of wit."

297
18:56.031 --> 18:59.159
I've got something I need to do too.

298
19:04.581 --> 19:08.335
Looks like we'll have to turn to the underworld.

299
19:24.142 --> 19:25.185
Something's coming.

300
19:39.283 --> 19:40.325
No way.

301
19:45.580 --> 19:46.999
Lord Tsuge!

302
19:47.082 --> 19:48.083
Lord Tsuge!

303
19:49.001 --> 19:50.794
You arrived sooner than expected.

304
19:50.877 --> 19:52.379
Where's the Sanada residence?

305
19:52.462 --> 19:54.715
Yes, sir! Over there.

306
19:55.257 --> 19:56.425
Tsuge…

307
19:56.508 --> 19:58.260
Tsuge Kiyohiro.

308
20:04.349 --> 20:06.018
Are you the master of this house?

309
20:08.812 --> 20:09.730
I am.

310
20:10.480 --> 20:12.566
I'm Sanada Yukimura.

311
20:13.608 --> 20:14.985
Where's the ninja?

312
20:16.778 --> 20:18.196
There are no ninja here.

313
20:22.242 --> 20:23.618
Something smells off.

314
20:24.453 --> 20:26.580
I smell a lie.

315
20:30.751 --> 20:32.919
Lord Tsuge, we've gathered them!

316
20:34.463 --> 20:36.506
Sanada's ninja.

317
20:37.632 --> 20:40.719
Answer me, or I'll kill them one by one.

318
20:41.303 --> 20:42.304
Hey!

319
20:43.138 --> 20:44.139
Where are you?

320
20:45.057 --> 20:46.183
I know you're here!

321
20:50.312 --> 20:51.313
Hey!

322
20:52.314 --> 20:55.150
Hurry up, or these people will die!

323
21:12.876 --> 21:13.919
Curved Shot,

324
21:15.045 --> 21:16.046
Wild God.

325
21:16.129 --> 21:17.506
CURVED SHOT, WILD GOD

326
21:25.847 --> 21:29.434
Found you.

327
21:51.206 --> 21:52.165
Unno…

328
22:00.757 --> 22:01.758
This guy…

329
22:02.551 --> 22:05.220
He's no ordinary villager, is he?

330
22:09.015 --> 22:12.519
The six coins he had on him…

331
22:13.812 --> 22:16.606
That was the Sanada clan's crest, right?

332
22:18.984 --> 22:20.110
What was it again?

333
22:21.403 --> 22:23.155
Pay six coins,

334
22:24.030 --> 22:27.200
and you'll do anything you're told.

335
22:28.160 --> 22:29.369
Was that it?

336
22:31.371 --> 22:32.747
He's your ninja, isn't he?

337
22:36.251 --> 22:37.169
No.

338
22:38.962 --> 22:40.046
Well, never mind.

339
22:40.922 --> 22:45.302
Once we're back at the castle, someone will recognize his face.

340
22:47.846 --> 22:49.389
If he was one of the ninja

341
22:50.390 --> 22:53.894
who fought at Ueda 14 years ago,

342
22:54.686 --> 22:56.646
what then?

343
23:10.660 --> 23:11.953
One of our men

344
23:12.787 --> 23:14.456
saw a stranger.

345
23:16.333 --> 23:19.377
He's your ninja, isn't he?

346
23:21.588 --> 23:22.547
Village headman.

347
23:23.548 --> 23:25.759
You knew and kept quiet for our sake.

348
23:27.135 --> 23:29.012
I'm grateful to you.

349
23:30.388 --> 23:32.766
But I can't keep this a secret…

350
23:34.768 --> 23:35.769
any longer.

351
23:36.436 --> 23:38.980
We'll pay for it too!

352
23:43.109 --> 23:44.361
Please leave!

353
23:56.831 --> 23:58.041
It's my fault.

354
24:01.836 --> 24:03.129
All because of me…

355
24:06.883 --> 24:07.968
Thanks to you,

356
24:09.636 --> 24:10.971
the villagers were spared.

357
24:18.144 --> 24:20.272
Even if Lord Daisuke hadn't moved,

358
24:21.731 --> 24:25.110
Unno would still have fired his arrow.

359
24:32.575 --> 24:34.202
Anayama is right.

360
24:35.495 --> 24:38.331
Without firearms, we stand no chance against them.

361
24:40.333 --> 24:42.544
Hope those guys are doing all right.

362
24:51.636 --> 24:55.140
What the hell are you doing?! I was wondering where you'd gone.

363
25:00.061 --> 25:00.937
These guys…

364
25:01.771 --> 25:02.981
They're Tokugawa ninja.

365
25:04.024 --> 25:08.695
If a woman needs help, of course, you help her.

366
25:22.000 --> 25:23.376
This is awful.

367
25:24.336 --> 25:25.879
We can't stay in this town anymore.

368
25:28.089 --> 25:29.924
Mist Concealment.

369
25:30.008 --> 25:31.509
My apologies.

370
25:31.593 --> 25:33.136
This is all his fault.

371
25:33.219 --> 25:35.597
But I thought she was a beautiful blonde.

372
25:36.348 --> 25:38.808
We have no choice but to give up on the firearms.

373
25:53.365 --> 25:54.949
We're running out of time.

374
25:55.575 --> 25:56.451
Then…

375
25:58.036 --> 25:59.079
tonight.

376
25:59.162 --> 26:00.622
Right.

377
26:00.997 --> 26:03.083
But we need someone who can use a bow.

378
26:09.839 --> 26:10.799
I can.

379
26:10.882 --> 26:12.884
Hey, what are you talking about?

380
26:12.967 --> 26:14.928
We've got old man Unno for that.

381
26:25.355 --> 26:28.274
So these are the children Hakuunsai raised.

382
26:29.317 --> 26:32.153
Yes. They'll make fine ninja.

383
26:43.331 --> 26:44.999
What spirit!

384
26:46.042 --> 26:47.460
Well done, well done.

385
27:03.017 --> 27:04.644
One day,

386
27:05.895 --> 27:08.022
you'll all become like this man.

387
27:09.149 --> 27:12.444
And I'll train you, and train you,

388
27:13.403 --> 27:14.946
and train you until you do.

389
27:18.908 --> 27:20.952
Tsuge was shot with an arrow in Kudoyama

390
27:21.035 --> 27:23.371
by a Sanada ninja

391
27:24.247 --> 27:25.540
disguised as a villager.

392
27:26.374 --> 27:27.375
Is that so?

393
27:43.683 --> 27:46.728
Is this indeed the face of one of them?

394
27:49.481 --> 27:50.440
Hanzo.

395
27:51.816 --> 27:52.692
Kill them.

396
27:54.194 --> 27:55.028
Kill them.

397
27:56.696 --> 27:58.823
Kill them all. Kill them all. Kill them all.

398
27:59.491 --> 28:00.325
Kill them.

399
28:03.620 --> 28:04.913
Not a single…

400
28:06.289 --> 28:08.750
Sanada ninja is to be left alive.

401
28:10.627 --> 28:11.544
Understood?

402
28:13.004 --> 28:13.838
Yes, sir.

403
28:14.672 --> 28:15.840
GRAVE OF UNNO ROKURO

404
28:15.924 --> 28:17.050
That guy…

405
28:18.343 --> 28:19.802
He was incredibly skilled.

406
28:22.013 --> 28:23.473
Why die in a place like this?

407
28:28.394 --> 28:29.854
Why die for someone else?

408
28:31.064 --> 28:32.607
I'll never understand it.

409
28:34.984 --> 28:36.110
That's fine.

410
28:38.154 --> 28:41.616
Unno believed in us when he gave his life.

411
28:43.076 --> 28:45.203
So we'll carry his hopes with us…

412
28:47.372 --> 28:48.456
and keep living.

413
28:52.168 --> 28:54.254
Unno told me about you.

414
28:55.338 --> 28:56.840
He called you the Flying Monkey.

415
28:58.716 --> 28:59.968
Sarutobi…

416
29:00.885 --> 29:01.719
Sasuke.

417
29:02.762 --> 29:04.973
From now on, your name is Sarutobi Sasuke.

418
29:06.015 --> 29:06.933
What?

419
29:07.892 --> 29:09.769
I don't need a surname.

420
29:11.229 --> 29:12.480
I'm no samurai.

421
29:13.982 --> 29:15.441
You're one of my braves too.

422
29:16.359 --> 29:21.739
Even if it's for money, you're willing to use your skills to help us.

423
29:24.409 --> 29:26.411
A ninja who serves no lord

424
29:27.203 --> 29:29.038
is just a thief.

425
29:29.122 --> 29:31.291
USE YOUR POWER FOR THE GOOD OF ALL HAKUUNSAI

426
29:32.709 --> 29:33.918
Sarutobi…

427
29:36.170 --> 29:37.297
Sasuke.

428
29:41.551 --> 29:42.594
Don't need it.

429
29:47.807 --> 29:51.019
This Sanada cord marks us as comrades.

430
29:52.562 --> 29:53.855
Wear it proudly.

431
30:07.368 --> 30:09.120
Everyone, we're leaving the village.

432
30:23.885 --> 30:25.929
I'll now explain

433
30:26.888 --> 30:27.805
our escape plan.

434
30:39.651 --> 30:40.610
Come on!

435
30:42.862 --> 30:43.905
You got me!

436
30:44.614 --> 30:47.951
-As expected of a Tokugawa samurai. -All right, one more round!

437
30:48.034 --> 30:50.411
-No, no. That's enough for today. -Why?

438
30:50.495 --> 30:52.205
I've had a bit too much to drink.

439
30:52.914 --> 30:53.748
Careful!

440
30:53.831 --> 30:55.458
First, Nezu will steal the key

441
30:55.541 --> 30:57.502
to the village-facing gate from the head clerk.

442
30:58.586 --> 31:00.004
Can you pull that off?

443
31:00.088 --> 31:03.216
We're all gambling buddies now. I can swipe it anytime.

444
31:03.299 --> 31:06.386
By the way, Nezu can use pretty much every ninja technique.

445
31:06.469 --> 31:08.221
He's just okay at all of them.

446
31:08.304 --> 31:09.430
Oh, come on.

447
31:09.514 --> 31:13.726
Once Nezu gets the key, we'll use it to open the checkpoint gate.

448
31:13.810 --> 31:15.687
But first, Sasuke…

449
31:29.367 --> 31:30.326
He flew!

450
31:32.245 --> 31:33.371
Amazing…

451
31:33.955 --> 31:37.375
That's exactly… the final piece our lord was waiting for.

452
31:42.714 --> 31:43.589
Yo.

453
32:00.648 --> 32:07.321
L-O-V-E U.

454
32:07.405 --> 32:08.656
Just kidding!

455
32:09.240 --> 32:10.575
That little punk…

456
32:11.868 --> 32:12.785
Let's go.

457
32:34.223 --> 32:35.099
All right.

458
33:19.268 --> 33:20.144
Good.

459
33:20.895 --> 33:22.480
Now it's up to the old man.

460
33:27.068 --> 33:28.111
The gate's open.

461
33:29.320 --> 33:30.613
Mochizuki.

462
33:30.696 --> 33:32.073
-I'm counting on you. -Yes, sir.

463
33:50.550 --> 33:51.467
Unno…

464
33:52.343 --> 33:54.053
lend us your strength.

465
34:05.648 --> 34:07.608
Come on, old man.

466
34:16.701 --> 34:18.077
Excuse me.

467
34:19.120 --> 34:20.454
What is it?

468
34:20.538 --> 34:23.332
We heard a suspicious noise. I'll have it checked, just in case.

469
34:28.171 --> 34:29.547
What about the scout ninja?

470
34:31.591 --> 34:32.800
What's going on?

471
34:35.511 --> 34:37.889
This is bad. The guards are coming out.

472
34:37.972 --> 34:40.391
Stay calm. Trust Seikai.

473
34:45.229 --> 34:47.190
What's going on at this hour?

474
34:47.273 --> 34:49.150
Apparently, there was a suspicious noise.

475
34:51.652 --> 34:52.570
Who's there?

476
34:53.779 --> 34:55.531
You must all be exhausted.

477
34:57.658 --> 34:59.619
Spiritual Medicine, Dream of the Butterfly.

478
35:02.455 --> 35:03.873
What is this…

479
35:08.294 --> 35:10.379
You'll be sleeping for a long, long time.

480
35:14.133 --> 35:15.051
Hey.

481
35:16.093 --> 35:18.137
What are you doing?!

482
35:18.221 --> 35:20.306
You fool! Hey.

483
35:21.766 --> 35:22.975
Scout ninja!

484
35:28.981 --> 35:29.815
And…

485
35:30.650 --> 35:31.525
who are you?

486
35:32.860 --> 35:34.320
Shakespeare said,

487
35:34.862 --> 35:40.618
"Fate carries your soul to the place where it belongs most."

488
35:45.414 --> 35:47.875
Can I help you with something?

489
35:49.460 --> 35:50.753
-There's no next time. -I know.

490
35:50.836 --> 35:52.713
-This is the last… -Just shut up.

491
35:56.842 --> 35:57.969
Sasuke?

492
36:00.513 --> 36:01.847
Someone's beside him.

493
36:03.349 --> 36:04.350
That's…

494
36:07.937 --> 36:09.480
the Westerner from before.

495
36:12.608 --> 36:15.111
So he's going to break the lock with a firearm.

496
36:23.035 --> 36:24.954
Looks like he got the message.

497
36:26.706 --> 36:28.666
So, what's your name?

498
36:29.792 --> 36:30.793
Cain Jude.

499
36:32.503 --> 36:33.796
Kakei Juzo?

500
36:34.463 --> 36:35.464
Cain…

501
36:38.259 --> 36:39.343
That'll do.

502
36:41.762 --> 36:43.389
Why did you come to help us?

503
36:44.432 --> 36:46.058
I repay my debts.

504
36:48.102 --> 36:49.979
You helped my comrades.

505
37:00.781 --> 37:03.451
You mean the fake blonde beauty?

506
37:06.203 --> 37:08.414
There are good ninja out there after all.

507
37:12.668 --> 37:14.170
What should we do, Lord Yukimura?

508
37:14.253 --> 37:16.339
If we use firearms, the gunshot will give us away.

509
37:16.422 --> 37:18.257
The enemy will know for sure!

510
37:18.341 --> 37:20.885
We could take our chances and run when the gun goes off.

511
37:39.904 --> 37:42.031
Raise the alarm! It's an emergency!

512
37:54.293 --> 37:55.169
The festival…

513
38:00.591 --> 38:03.135
This should mask the gunshot.

514
38:11.602 --> 38:12.645
Lucky us.

515
38:15.606 --> 38:17.400
-The lock's undone! -So is the bolt!

516
38:17.483 --> 38:19.735
-How come? -Let's just get going.

517
38:19.819 --> 38:20.820
Right!

518
38:30.538 --> 38:32.581
What's that sound?

519
38:35.668 --> 38:36.710
Lord Shuto!

520
38:38.421 --> 38:39.880
What's with the festival music?

521
38:39.964 --> 38:41.048
What's going on?

522
38:42.091 --> 38:43.175
Leave this to me.

523
38:44.260 --> 38:46.178
Go check on the village.

524
38:46.262 --> 38:47.263
Yes, sir!

525
38:47.346 --> 38:48.389
-Let's go. -Right!

526
39:31.098 --> 39:32.391
All right.

527
39:54.079 --> 39:55.206
We did it!

528
40:06.884 --> 40:07.801
Let's go.

529
40:11.180 --> 40:12.097
Sasuke?

530
40:13.224 --> 40:14.183
Okuni.

531
40:14.266 --> 40:16.268
Are you heading to Osaka?

532
40:16.352 --> 40:17.353
Yeah.

533
40:17.436 --> 40:18.812
Here.

534
40:18.896 --> 40:20.523
I wove this with all my heart.

535
40:20.606 --> 40:22.775
I'm sure it'll protect you, Sasuke.

536
40:24.568 --> 40:25.945
-Thank you. -Of course.

537
40:30.533 --> 40:31.450
Let's hurry!

538
40:32.034 --> 40:32.952
All right!

539
40:33.911 --> 40:34.954
-We did it. -Yeah.

540
40:35.037 --> 40:36.914
Damn you, Sanada Yukimura!

541
40:38.165 --> 40:39.375
You won't get away!

542
40:40.376 --> 40:42.795
Sanada!

543
40:48.050 --> 40:49.468
What are they doing?

544
40:58.143 --> 41:00.896
At least let my grandchildren

545
41:01.897 --> 41:04.567
live in a world where hard work

546
41:04.650 --> 41:06.986
earns people enough to eat!

547
41:08.404 --> 41:09.572
Village headman…

548
41:11.323 --> 41:12.783
I'm counting on you!

549
41:12.866 --> 41:13.867
Did you…

550
41:14.368 --> 41:17.204
play that festival music to help him escape?

551
41:17.288 --> 41:18.330
Shinkichi!

552
41:30.092 --> 41:32.428
Stay away!

553
41:35.097 --> 41:38.017
Sanada Yukimura…

554
41:41.854 --> 41:46.692
Go!

555
42:01.332 --> 42:02.333
Let's go.

556
42:29.068 --> 42:30.069
Too bad.

557
42:31.695 --> 42:35.741
Old man Yukimura's already long gone.

558
42:37.159 --> 42:38.452
I don't recognize you.

559
42:40.746 --> 42:41.830
Who are you?

560
42:49.338 --> 42:51.965
The peerless flying ninja…

561
42:54.968 --> 42:56.053
Sasuke.

562
42:57.638 --> 42:58.639
No.

563
43:01.392 --> 43:02.685
Sarutobi…

564
43:04.269 --> 43:05.896
Sasuke!

565
43:08.190 --> 43:09.858
Feel the weight of the lives…

566
43:13.654 --> 43:15.072
you've taken!

567
44:09.793 --> 44:12.671
I'm hungover…

568
44:12.755 --> 44:16.258
and pissed off!

569
44:21.555 --> 44:24.183
Dual Barrage of the Eight Drunks.

570
44:24.266 --> 44:25.601
DUAL BARRAGE OF THE EIGHT DRUNKS

571
44:52.044 --> 44:53.212
Amazing…

572
44:56.173 --> 44:57.841
I smell blood.

573
45:12.814 --> 45:14.316
Die!

574
45:20.864 --> 45:21.949
Rising Serpent…

575
45:22.866 --> 45:24.284
Sickle Weasel!

576
45:42.970 --> 45:46.598
Thanks for everything these past 14 years.

577
45:52.312 --> 45:54.106
You're all together.

578
45:55.691 --> 45:57.359
You won't be lonely.

579
46:02.281 --> 46:03.782
Damn Shuto.

580
46:04.741 --> 46:06.535
He let them get away.

581
46:09.121 --> 46:10.747
Where are they headed?

582
46:12.040 --> 46:12.916
Apparently…

583
46:13.750 --> 46:14.585
Osaka.

584
46:16.587 --> 46:17.754
South, huh?

585
46:17.838 --> 46:19.339
No, north.

586
46:29.016 --> 46:31.018
Subtitle translation by: Sayo Takada

587
46:31.101 --> 46:33.020
THIS DRAMA IS A WORK OF FICTION
